%description
TeX Live basic collection (Essential programs and files) — the texmf-dist data tree
from tlnet snapshot 20260927, without documentation. Binaries come from
Fedora's texlive packaging; install texlive-meta for the whole scheme.

%build
mkdir -p raw
cat > members.txt <<'EOF'
amsfonts
bibtex
cm
colorprofiles
dvipdfmx
dvips
